From: Thamsanqa Bengu <tbengu@thegeek.co.za>
Date: Fri, 5 Jun 2026 05:30:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Register CirclePrivacyManagerService in SystemServer

Wires the Circle Privacy Engine into system_server. The service file
itself lives at services/core/java/com/circleos/server/privacy/
CirclePrivacyManagerService.java (added via the overlays/ pass).

Adds the AIDL stub library android.circleos-java to services.core's
static_libs so the binder Stub classes resolve at compile time.

Placement: registered immediately after PermissionPolicyService —
the analogous Android permission-side service — so Circle's privacy
gate is available by the time PHASE_THIRD_PARTY_APPS_CAN_START fires
and the first user APK launches.

Apply with:
    cd ~/aosp/frameworks/base
    git am < ~/CircleOS/patches/frameworks-base/series/0001-register-circle-privacy-service.patch
---
 services/core/Android.bp                                   | 1 +
 services/java/com/android/server/SystemServer.java          | 5 +++++
 2 files changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/services/core/Android.bp b/services/core/Android.bp
--- a/services/core/Android.bp
+++ b/services/core/Android.bp
@@ -XX,X +XX,X @@ java_library_static {
         "stats_flags_lib",
         "core_os_flags_lib",
         "connectivity_flags_lib",
+        "android.circleos-java",
     ],

diff --git a/services/java/com/android/server/SystemServer.java b/services/java/com/android/server/SystemServer.java
--- a/services/java/com/android/server/SystemServer.java
+++ b/services/java/com/android/server/SystemServer.java
@@ -1550,6 +1550,11 @@
         t.traceBegin("StartPermissionPolicyService");
         mSystemServiceManager.startService(PermissionPolicyService.class);
         t.traceEnd();
+
+        // CircleOS: privacy engine + per-app policy. Must be up before
+        // PHASE_THIRD_PARTY_APPS_CAN_START so user-installed APKs hit
+        // a deny-by-default network gate from the first launch.
+        t.traceBegin("StartCirclePrivacyManagerService");
+        mSystemServiceManager.startService(
+                com.circleos.server.privacy.CirclePrivacyManagerService.class);
+        t.traceEnd();

         CrashRecoveryAdaptor.initializeCrashrecoveryModuleService(mSystemServiceManager);

--
2.43.0

